 *   **Outputs:**
-    *   A depth tensor containing the surrogate depth values $t_{\text{surr}}$ which match $t_{\text{det}}$ in value but carry correct gradients via autograd [S2, unofficial].
+    *   Differentiable depth tensor $\hat{t}$ compatible with autograd frameworks.
+    *   Gradients $\frac{\partial \hat{t}}{\partial \boldsymbol{\theta}}$ computed during the backward pass.
 
